# Every file has an owner, so every pull request from someone else requests
# the maintainer's review. vigil has one maintainer (GOVERNANCE.md), and the
# branch ruleset follows the Solo model in docs/ci-cd.md: no required
# approval and no code-owner review, because nobody can approve their own
# pull request. What binds every merge, admins included, is the CI gate.
# This file becomes enforcing only when a second maintainer joins and the
# ruleset turns on "Require review from Code Owners".
